WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.210
I didn't know

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.010
what warmth felt like,

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.350
what it meant to be kind,

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.160
or what affection was.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.740
And above all,

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.780
I could not comprehend

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:31.070
the concept of love.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.950
But I get it now.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.640
I've finally...

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:48.520
come to understand...

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:52.000
what love really means.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:03.960
This is the story of our love.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:41.340
Satou Matsuzaka, please go out with me.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:48.520
Sorry. I've already given my heart to someone else.

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:50.250
Hey!

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.750
You get rejected?

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:54.830
Not even.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:57.290
You said she'd let you bang her, dude.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.130
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.700
You're going to be late for work.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:05.720
Sorry.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.600
Those guys were hitting on you, right?

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:12.750
Are you guys hanging out after work?

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:17.020
No. I'm done doing that kind of stuff, Shoko-chan.

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:19.980
I've fallen in love.

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:24.650
You're kidding! You've got a revolving door of men!

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:26.760
We've started living together.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.930
You're not wasting any time.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.910
Don't tell anyone.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.270
You're the only person I've told.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.790
Okay.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:38.040
That's why I have to make more money.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.960
He's a kept man?

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:48.290
I didn't know you were the type
who likes babying guys.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:52.220
Hey, let's fool around with guys again together.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.560
More importantly, Shoko-chan...

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:57.520
What is it?

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.320
Did you gain weight?

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:06.970
I can tell you're 2 percent over your ideal body fat
just by touching your body.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.530
Shoko-chan, if you want to land a man,

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:11.930
you have to maintain your figure.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:15.310
How can you know just by touching?

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:21.170
Welcome home, master!

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:24.010
There, it's a cat!

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.800
It's so cute!

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:30.180
I hope it's delicious! I hope it's delicious!

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.970
-Congratulations!
-Thanks.

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:47.430
Right. I found it.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.490
My beloved.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:52.680
I'm home!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:03.840
Satou-chan! Welcome back, Satou-chan!

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.470
This nice, sweet smell.

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.270
The girl I found.

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:13.020
Shio-chan.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:15.330
My beloved.

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:19.310
Were you waiting at the front door?
Wasn't it cold?

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:23.420
I'm fine.
I wanted to welcome you home, Satou-chan.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.280
You're so cute, Shio-chan.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:30.610
I met Shio-chan a few days ago.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:40.330
Bubble... bubble...

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:45.090
Hey, Satou-chan, how come the chick floats?

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:51.120
She wouldn't understand
an explanation of Archimedes' principle.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:56.300
The water is trying to help the chick.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:59.020
Wow, you're like a professor, Satou-chan!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:03.460
Shio-chan doesn't know about a lot of things.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.230
Hey. Hey.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:07.650
I'll be your water, Satou-chan!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.110
Then I'm going to help you

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:14.070
just like this chick!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.040
She's so innocent, so pure.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.830
Shio-chan is so cute.

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:30.590
Satou-chan, here we go!

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:32.510
Go ahead, Shio-chan.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:40.890
Our vows.

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:44.270
In sickness and in health...

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:49.110
-This girl is the sweetest thing in the world.
-through happiness and sadness...

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:52.030
for richer, for poorer...

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:55.530
She fulfills my heart.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:59.120
I promise to love you, Satou-chan,

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.480
until death do us part...

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:04.400
This sparkling emotion must be...

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:09.250
what they call love.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.880
Satou-chan.

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:17.630
I'm so happy.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:20.020
I want to stay like this forever.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.400
But I can't.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.160
We need money to live.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:33.260
For food, utilities, furniture, and clothes...

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.610
That's why I have to work.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.710
Sorry, Shio-chan.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:52.940
My new job starts today,
so I'll be home late.

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:54.630
Will you be okay on your own?

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:59.480
I know

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:02.860
that you're working hard for me!

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:05.710
So I'll stay here and pray

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.440
that we'll be able to be together forever.

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:11.340
Shio-chan...

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:13.660
Okay, Shio-chan.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.700
I'm going to work hard.

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:19.560
I'm Satou Matsuzaka. I'm new here.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.600
I'm going to work hard to learn fast.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.190
Nice to meet you.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.040
I'm so glad you came, Matsuzaka.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.120
We're short on staff these days.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:32.750
You've worked in customer service, right?

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:34.200
We're counting on you.

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:36.680
Okay.

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:42.430
Matsuzaka. Let me teach you how to take orders.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.870
I know how to work this.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:48.020
Really? Then can you work the floor now?

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:51.900
Yes. If I do something wrong, just tell me.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.690
Okay. Got it.

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:55.860
Welcome!

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.890
How's the new job?

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:04.660
The manager is young, kind, and pretty, right?

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.770
Yeah. The other employees are all nice too.

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:11.460
-I won't allow it, you know.
-Shoko-chan?

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:14.920
You can't spend all your time at your new job! Got it?

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:16.660
I wouldn't do that.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:19.340
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:27.670
Shio-chan, we don't get that channel.

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.750
Work, huh?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.270
Well...

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:35.940
as long as nothing troublesome happens...

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:40.720
I like you.
Will you go out with me?

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:47.330
You can give me an answer after your shift's over.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:48.870
No...

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:50.020
Sorry.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:53.820
I've already given my heart to someone else.

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:01.730
Satou, I saw you

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:04.050
rejecting Mitsuboshi.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:07.930
Mitsuboshi's really cool.
If you rejected him,

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:11.930
the guy you've given your heart to
must be gorgeous.

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:13.850
He's not a gorgeous guy.

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.920
There you go again...

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.230
You're lucky.

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:20.320
I wish I was pretty like you, Satou.

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:22.650
Then I would've been more popular with guys.

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:24.070
That's not true...

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:28.160
I think you guys are cute when you're smiling.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:30.290
So please smile more.

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.080
I love you, Satou!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.860
I can see why she's so popular.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:41.210
The guys are into her these days.

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:45.140
They were all about the manager up until now, though.

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.520
Thanks for your hard work.

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:51.940
Got to get home quickly.

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:08.890
Mitsuboshi stopped coming to work the next day.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:13.360
Matsuzaka, can you work overtime today?

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:16.120
I thought you said there's no overtime.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:18.130
We're short on staff.

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:21.030
And I can't get through to Mitsuboshi.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:24.760
It's your fault he's not coming anymore, isn't it?

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.750
Mitsuboshi was crying.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:30.250
He said you made a fool out of him.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:34.630
So it's only natural that you take responsibility for this.

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:37.560
Okay, Matsuzaka?

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:38.730
But...

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:42.300
Poor Satou...

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:47.410
-Thanks.
-Thanks for your hard work.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:57.580
Oh, sorry.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:00.210
-It was an accident.
-I see...

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.320
Um...

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.670
Don't tell anyone that I snitched.

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:08.300
Do you understand?

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:11.960
I've been working here longer.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.890
If you want to keep working here like nothing happened,

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:18.300
then you should do exactly as the manager says.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.730
Thanks for your hard work.

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:27.450
Matsuzaka.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:31.490
The bathroom and break room too, thank you.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:46.470
Things went on like that for a while...

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:11.150
This...

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:13.180
This can't go on...

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.260
Satou-chan...

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:33.430
I can't go on like this.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:36.430
The bottle inside me is breaking.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:39.290
The sweet pieces are scattering.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:43.330
Don't go anywhere.
Those are pieces of my love.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.030
Pieces of my heart.

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:49.090
If this keeps up, I...

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:52.160
I'll go crazy.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:59.020
Thanks for your hard work today.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:02.910
Don't forget to check your paystubs.

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:05.030
Okay!

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:11.870
Excuse me, manager?

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:13.300
Can I ask you something?

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:16.000
Was there a mistake?

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.560
The payment doesn't match the hours I worked.
There's a mistake.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:19.880
No. It's correct.
The payment doesn't match the hours I worked.
There's a mistake.

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:21.810
No. It's correct.

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:24.640
Matsuzaka,

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.310
you know why, don't you?

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:30.530
No. I worked like I was supposed to.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:34.200
Oh, that's too bad.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.820
Really, you...

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:41.190
You're just a little cute,
and you think you can get away with anything.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.210
I bet people went easy on you

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:46.710
and made a big fuss over you
just because you're cute.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:49.030
But life isn't that easy.

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.760
You caused trouble here.

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.910
That's why your pay was cut.

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:55.870
You understand, don't you?

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:59.390
Are you allowed to cut my pay whenever you want?

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:00.540
Yes.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:03.930
This place is my kingdom of love.

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:07.420
I'm the master.
I have no need for anyone who doesn't love me.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.780
No matter who it is.

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.440
Love?

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.400
That's right, Matsuzaka,

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:17.530
I love you too.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:28.120
I'll swallow any desire you have.

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.990
After all, Satou-chan...

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:32.880
that's what love is.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:34.550
No.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:37.800
I can't agree to this.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:41.180
You can't. It's just wrong.

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:44.310
You're not supposed to go after underage kids.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:47.980
-What?
-I saw it.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:51.270
You brought Mitsuboshi here.

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:54.530
So what?
Enough with the false pretenses.

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.180
They're hardly false.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.950
This place is thick with

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:02.410
the scent of you and Mitsuboshi's deeds.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:09.360
It's like your gross, damp smell
swallowed up Mitsuboshi.

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:12.460
-What?
-Then...

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:15.450
I'll just have to ask Mitsuboshi directly.

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:18.170
Well, you won't be able to.

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:19.410
Why's that?

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:22.140
I can.

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:25.640
I said I can.

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:30.980
What's going to happen after that?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.690
The kind and pretty manager

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:38.310
is going to be charged with sexual misconduct.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:43.450
Could your majesty endure
having everyone look at you with disgust?

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.620
Who do you think you are?

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:49.910
You're just a kid!
You're supposed to respect adults!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:54.070
How come you weren't able to control yourself
with a kid?

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:54.360
-What?
-Did it sting that badly...
How come you weren't able to control yourself
with a kid?

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.820
-What?
-Did it sting that badly...

00:16:56.820 --> 00:17:00.640
for everyone to pay more attention
to a kid like me than you?

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:03.470
Of course it did!

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:05.790
You guys are supposed to love me!

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:09.060
But Mitsuboshi said he loved you.

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:12.380
So I taught him about my love.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.990
I made sure to thoroughly teach his body.

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:23.980
Of course it did!

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:26.410
What an amazing face.

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:28.560
Give that to me!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.880
I'll upload it somewhere.

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.440
Who do you think you are?

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:35.400
Are you threatening me?

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:38.280
Are you trying to destroy my kingdom?

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:42.560
I don't care about your kingdom.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:46.260
I don't care what you do here,
or how you behave.

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:49.000
It really didn't matter one way or the other.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.920
Then why?

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:54.560
Why didn't you control yourself?

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:56.860
I controlled myself.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:59.230
I worked overtime and I cleaned up.

00:17:59.230 --> 00:17:59.600
Because it was part of my job.
I worked overtime and I cleaned up.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.390
Because it was part of my job.

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:06.530
I had less time to spend with Shio-chan,

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:08.830
but I controlled myself and did it all.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.750
What are you talking about?

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:15.150
You should have controlled yourself too.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:19.870
Then neither of us would have had to go through this.

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:23.490
What--? What are you saying?

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:27.720
What you feel may not be love.

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:30.180
Love...

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:33.460
is something your heart feels by itself.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.440
It's sweet, it sparkles,

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:39.510
and it makes you realize what makes you happy

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:43.030
without anyone telling you.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:45.990
If you had to teach him about your love...

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:49.120
If you ask for something in return...

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:51.370
Something bad and bitter like that...

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:53.690
That's not love.

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:56.110
Hey, manager.

00:18:56.110 --> 00:19:00.120
Even if it doesn't interest me,
if it's unsightly I want to break it.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:01.880
I'm sure you know the feeling.

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:08.890
It's okay.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:12.270
Just pay me what I'm owed, okay?

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:21.280
Are you okay, Mitsuboshi?

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.900
Be careful.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:28.200
Women have a strong desire
to keep people to themselves.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:38.150
So bitter...

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:41.280
So bitter...
So bitter...

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:45.430
So bitter... So bitter... So bitter...

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:49.310
Satou-chan, welcome back!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.060
Shio-chan, I'm home!

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:57.770
It's so late. You stayed up?

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:02.520
Yeah.
I didn't like falling asleep

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:06.280
without being able to say "Welcome back!"

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:08.990
Shio-chan...

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:17.620
The sick feeling in my stomach went away.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:19.750
I've never felt like this before.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:21.170
I'm so happy.

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:27.220
I love you, Shio-chan.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:52.120
I've never loved anyone before.

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:05.820
I've had lots of people tell me they love me.

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:10.640
But no matter what they told me...

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:13.810
or what they did for me...

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.270
I never felt anything.

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:28.720
But this is different.

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:32.950
Shio-chan gave me the gift of love.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:39.710
I'm sure she's going to teach me more and more
about love in the future.

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.470
Hey, thanks.

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:53.600
Your house is pretty comfortable.

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:06.240
That's why I have to...

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:08.970
protect this valuable emotion,

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:12.070
and create a castle so the love doesn't spill out.

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:18.080
The sweetest castle in the world,
where I can live happily with Shio-chan forever.

00:22:24.330 --> 00:22:26.530
What I have to do...

00:22:27.960 --> 00:22:31.840
This is in the way. I have to throw it away somewhere.

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:38.670
Hello,

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:40.690
happy sugar life.

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:15.610
I'm sure this is love.

00:24:16.150 --> 00:24:20.740
I'd do anything to protect this feeling.

00:24:21.530 --> 00:24:23.160
2nd Life,

00:24:23.160 --> 00:24:24.810
"Shio's Miniature Garden."
